@music hyunjun
> He runs the last eight bars of something. No music. You can hear his sneakers and his breathing and, very quietly, him counting.
> Then the pose. Arm up. Chin turned. Weight back.
you: One.
> *The floor*, his mouth says, without sound.
you: Two. Three.
> *The lights. The bag.*
you: Four.
